{"id":33609309970,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAH00VfEg","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-22059-datavalueaudit-trigger-ownership-v43","head_sha":"2abbaa0bb67886f07f8ea3599059d6754f1a3362","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":56013,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: make 2.43 datavalueaudit trigger migration ownership-safe and reseed the sequence","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":91074347823,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAVNHRDLw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970","created_at":"2026-09-02T08:33:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T08:50:25Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-02T08:33:07Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/91074347823","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33609309970/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: make 2.43 datavalueaudit trigger fix ownership-safe and reseed the sequence\n\nBackport of the DHIS2-22059 fix (branch fix/DHIS2-22059-datavalueaudit-trigger-ownership\non master) to the 2.43 line, plus one additional defect found while porting.\n\nV2_43_68 (PR #25010, merged into 2.43 as 7b6021bdd6) used CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION on\nlog_datavalue_audit(), which was originally created by V2_43_17. That requires the\nconnecting role to already own the function (or be superuser) - on environments where\nmigrations run as a different role than the one that ran V2_43_17 (e.g. a database\nrefreshed from a dump/snapshot without normalizing object ownership), it fails with\n\"must be owner of function log_datavalue_audit\". Since FlywayConfig groups all pending\nmigrations into one transaction, that failure blocks every later migration too.\n\nFixed the same way as V2_44_23 on master: define the corrected logic under a new\nfunction name (log_datavalue_audit_v2) and repoint trg_datavalue_audit to it, since\nretargeting a trigger only requires ownership of the table, not of the function it\ncalls.\n\nAlso: V2_43_68 as merged was missing the select setval('datavalueaudit_sequence', ...)\nreseed that V2_44_23 has. datavalueaudit_sequence has been dead since V2_43_17 in the\n2.43 line too, so switching the trigger back to it without reseeding first would emit\nan id that already exists in datavalueaudit (inserted via hibernate_sequence in the\nmeantime), causing \"duplicate key value violates unique constraint datavalueaudit_pkey\"\non the very next data value save. Reproduced this independently of the ownership issue\nagainst a local Postgres 14 instance (sequence drift only, matching owner) before\nadding the reseed line back.\n\nLive-validated against a local Postgres 14 instance with both defects reproduced\ntogether (function owned by a different role + sequence drift): the merged V2_43_68\nhits both failures; this rewrite applies cleanly in a single transaction and produces\ncorrect, non-colliding audit rows afterward.\n\n[DHIS2-22059]\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"2abbaa0bb67886f07f8ea3599059d6754f1a3362","tree_id":"f27261efaeb00df8e0a35e53d5e111de029df737","timestamp":"2026-09-02T08:32:47Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":